A1%E6%9D%B1%E9%80%BE7000%E8%90%AC%E5%A2%9E%E6%8C%81?mtc=20023</id><title>大戶手影｜建滔獲大股東逾7000萬增持</title><updated>2026-04-11T12:56:00+08:00</updated><content type="html"/><link href="https://invest.hket.com/article/4111331/%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%B6%E6%89%8B%E5%BD%B1%EF%BD%9C%E5%BB%BA%E6%BB%94%E7%8D%B2%E5%A4%A7%E8%82%A1%E6%9D%B1%E9%80%BE7000%E8%90%AC%E5%A2%9E%E6%8C%81?mtc=20023"/><published>2026-04-11T12:56:00+08:00</published></entry><entry><id>https://topick.hket.com/article/4108217/%E9%A3%B2%E8%8C%B6%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%EF%BD%9C%E4%B8%80%E7%9B%85%E5%85%A9%E4%BB%B6%E9%A3%B2%E8%8C%B6%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%B0%87%E6%88%90%E9%81%8E%E5%8E%BB%EF%BC%9F%E3%80%80%E9%85%92%E6%A8%934%E4%BD%8D%E9%A3%9F%E5%AE%A2%E9%99%901%E5%B0%8F%E6%99%82%E4%BA%A4%E6%9E%B1%E6%83%B9%E8%AD%B0?mtc=20023</id><title>飲茶文化｜一盅兩件飲茶文化將成過去？　酒樓4位食客限1小時交枱惹議</title><updated>2026-04-11T13:03:00+08:00</updated><content type="html">

&lt;p&gt;Published on: 2026-04-11T13:03:00+08:00 Updated on: 2026-04-11T10:18:24.977+08:00&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="article-detail-content-container"&gt;
&lt;div class="non-paywall"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;香港的飲茶文化，講究「一盅兩件」與親友一邊聊天一邊慢慢品味；不過，本港飲食業近年來可謂是出於「寒冬」，面對營收壓力，食肆會盡可能接待更多客人以提高收益。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;近日，有食客在&lt;a href="https://www.threads.com/@yuki.kwok1221/post/DWaY9ZykWMl" target="_blank"&gt;Threads&lt;/a&gt;發帖，稱有酒樓設提示，限制繁忙時段的用膳時間，被指是「催交枱」惹來網民熱議，部分人認為餐廳態度惡劣，亦有人對此表示理解。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://topick.hket.com/article/4088162/飲茶文化｜酒樓全場長者冇後生仔去飲茶　網民拆解5大原因嘆飲茶文化將「滅亡」？?lcc=at"&gt;飲茶文化｜酒樓全場長者冇後生仔去飲茶　網民拆解5大原因嘆飲茶文化將「滅亡」？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;飲茶文化｜4位食客限1小時用膳交枱&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;樓主當日到一間酒樓飲茶，起初並未留意用膳限時，入座後見到「一個鐘多少少個知客態度好差咁話要走，我先知，下次係門口要望清楚有無限時先入」。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;span class="article-detail_inline-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/657449748_17922382998286060_6356052251933048309_n_1200.jpg" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/657449748_17922382998286060_6356052251933048309_n_600.jpg" media="(min-width: 992px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/657449748_17922382998286060_6356052251933048309_n_1024.jpg" media="(min-width: 630px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/657449748_17922382998286060_6356052251933048309_n_600.jpg" media="(min-width: 330px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/657449748_17922382998286060_6356052251933048309_n_300.jpg" media="(min-width: 0px)"/&gt;
&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="酒樓4位食客限1小時交枱惹議。（取自Threads）" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/657449748_17922382998286060_6356052251933048309_n_1200.jpg" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/657449748_17922382998286060_6356052251933048309_n_1200.jpg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="article-detail_caption block"&gt;&lt;span&gt;▲&lt;/span&gt; 酒樓4位食客限1小時交枱惹議。（取自Threads）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;據酒樓門口的「溫馨提示」列明：「繁忙時段枱位有限，4位一下：請與1小時交枱；5-7位：請與1小時15分交枱；8位以上，請與1小時30分交枱；客人到一半人數方可入座」。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;樓主表示雖能夠理解「枱位緊張」，但認為「老師講，飲茶1個鐘真係有啲太短，啲水又熱，點心入紙蒸都要20分鐘，食得仲趕過茶記，90-120分鐘合理啲」。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;飲茶文化｜網民反應兩極：理解vs趕客&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖文引起熱議，網民反應兩極，不少人認為食肆規定不合理，亦有人對此表示理解，「佢生意咁多，我唔去阻佢了」、「去飲茶就係想同朋友家人慢慢傾下計，限我時間咁我咪去第二間咯」、「其實各有各難，生意難做，茶室一向冇太多盈利」、「咁好生意唔好入去阻佢了」、「飲個茶都要趕命」。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;span class="article-detail_inline-image block"&gt;
&lt;picture class="image-gallery-img"&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/w1ARz5QCqS5G3taHbylxg9cc0ETlUFTVdEMwBXRDMAU_1200.jpg" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/w1ARz5QCqS5G3taHbylxg9cc0ETlUFTVdEMwBXRDMAU_600.jpg" media="(min-width: 992px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/w1ARz5QCqS5G3taHbylxg9cc0ETlUFTVdEMwBXRDMAU_1024.jpg" media="(min-width: 630px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/w1ARz5QCqS5G3taHbylxg9cc0ETlUFTVdEMwBXRDMAU_600.jpg" media="(min-width: 330px)"/&gt;
&lt;source data-srcset="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/w1ARz5QCqS5G3taHbylxg9cc0ETlUFTVdEMwBXRDMAU_300.jpg" media="(min-width: 0px)"/&gt;
&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="酒樓4位食客限1小時交枱惹議。（《開心速遞》劇照）" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/w1ARz5QCqS5G3taHbylxg9cc0ETlUFTVdEMwBXRDMAU_1200.jpg" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4105000/4108217/w1ARz5QCqS5G3taHbylxg9cc0ETlUFTVdEMwBXRDMAU_1200.jpg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="article-detail_caption block"&gt;&lt;span&gt;▲&lt;/span&gt; 酒樓4位食客限1小時交枱惹議。（《開心速遞》劇照）&lt;/span&gt;
